security, and alter the way we transmit information. While quantum computers exist in the physical world, the concept
of quantumInternetis currently theoretical.In its infant form, the quantum Internetpromises to make the digital      
domain safer, more productive,and more powerful than ever before.In this study, we provide a primer on quantum       
Internet, which provides a large-scale application of advanced quantum communication technologies and protocols.}    
